Subject: SUMMARY: Deletion tracking requirement
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2009 09:00:00 -0500

Requirement consolidated:

The system should count and track record deletions (e.g., item records,
patron records) per location and per system. Tracking should include:
- Record type
- Timestamp
- User who performed the deletion
- Location of the user

Additionally, tracking of denied deletion attempts would be helpful for
compliance and troubleshooting.

Robert will implement the database triggers. Katherine will draft the
report interface requirements.

